# Codex: merge into $DIR/home/.codex/config.toml (`mcpdef connect codex --write` does it)
[mcp_servers.mcpdef]
url = "https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp"

# or:
codex mcp add mcpdef --url https://127.0.0.1:8443/mcp

The gateway's certificate is from its own CA. Before starting Codex: export CODEX_CA_CERTIFICATE=$DIR/state/tls/ca.crt
